Per-packet overhead (all platforms), tun2proxy part. Apply at the tun2proxy root with patch -p1, after 0006b.
traffic_status_update locked a global Mutex for every relayed chunk just to learn that no callback was registered.
An AtomicBool set in tun2proxy_set_traffic_status_callback makes that case lock-free; behaviour with a callback is
unchanged.

